id: pm-beads-qkin
title: Point the npm homepage at the package catalog and link the author
description: Apply the owner-requested package homepage and linked author metadata; verify the matching GitHub repository website. Published npm metadata updates with the next release.
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-beads#175"
